  "prefLabel": "Plc 607.03 Additional Information Required for License Renewal Application",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 607.03 Additional Information Required for License Renewal Application.\n\n(a) In addition to the information required by Plc 308.06, the applicant for renewal of a practitioner license shall provide the following information for each continuing education course taken by the applicant:\n\n(1) The name of the course;\n\n(2) The name and address of the course sponsor;\n\n(3) The date(s) of the course;\n\n(4) The number of continuing education hours claimed for the course; and\n\n(5) The location where the course was presented.\n\n(b) Submission of the information shall constitute the applicant’s attestation that the applicant has met all continuing education requirements.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 600) #12622, eff 9-21-18 (formerly Plc 402.01); ss by #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36 (formerly Plc 602.01)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc600.html"
